  "body": "Tucked away from the road down a quiet driveway, this substantial family home delivers a private, mews-style retreat in the heart of St Heliers.\r\n\r\nDesigned with versatility in mind, the generous floor plan features two separate living areas, the main flowing seamlessly through bi-fold doors to a sun-drenched, private courtyard, perfect for afternoon relaxation or evening drinks with friends.  \r\n\r\nWith internal access garaging, the ground level comprises the main living areas kitchen/dining and conservatory. The first floor hosts the master bedroom, complete with a walk-in wardrobe and en-suite along with a further two bedrooms, the third opening onto a large balcony, alongside a generous family bathroom.  The upper level sanctuary houses a fourth spacious bedroom perfect for family/guests or as a teenage retreat.\r\n\r\nBuilt for easy coastal living, the property boasts incredible parking capacity, including double garaging, off-street parks, and rare dedicated space for a boat or RV. Just moments away, the vibrant St Heliers Village awaits with its boutique shops, cafés, restaurants overlooking the pristine waters of the beach, making morning runs around the bays or relaxed weekends by the sea an effortless part of daily life.\r\n\r\nOffering exceptional space, privacy, and an unbeatable Eastern Bays lifestyle at an attractive price point, this home is equally suited to growing families and professionals alike. To complete the package, top-tier education is right on your doorstep with St Heliers School and Glendowie College both within easy walking distance.",
